    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468-a2">

                <pb facs="0578" n="470" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg470"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Gen. Wheaton to
                            Adjutant-General U. S. Army.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Antonio, Tex.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November 18,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Dispatch of 18th received. Maj. Henton, with company of infantry from old Fort
                    Bliss in wagons and detachment of 30 cavalry from Fort Hancock, ordered to San
                    Elizario.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wheaton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Brigadier-General,
                    Commanding.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
